    "detailed_description": "Mini Mania is a new single player game from Pixel Playground Studio. Set in your Grandad's mysterious Laboratories, Mini Mania has been Nominated as one of the most innovative new games from UWE's Graduates and will offer up to an hours of unique gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is designed to change the way players approach, manipulate, and surmise the possibilities in a given environment; similar to how Portal\u2122's Portal Gun innovated new ways to leverage an you're environment in any given situation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers must solve physical puzzles and challenges by using a shrink ray to manipulate the size of objects, and themselves, through space.",
